WEBVTT

00:39:29.876 --> 00:39:32.956
and 5,000 the United States
that are still pointed at each other,

00:39:32.996 --> 00:39:35.636
and they still have the potential
to destroy the planet.

00:39:35.636 --> 00:39:39.316
And we haven't had any real
lessons that we've been able to learn

00:39:39.356 --> 00:39:41.956
institutionally from 1962.

00:39:42.356 --> 00:39:44.956
BG: 5,000 being a generic figure,
not the exact figure,

00:39:44.956 --> 00:39:47.116
but we are kind of
in that order of magnitude.

00:39:47.716 --> 00:39:50.956
Then of course, there is the question
of civilian nuclear,

00:39:50.996 --> 00:39:53.596
so the two power plants,
nuclear power plants,

00:39:53.596 --> 00:39:55.636
that have been seized by the Russians.

00:39:55.676 --> 00:39:58.596
One has been slightly damaged by a bomb,

00:39:58.636 --> 00:40:00.436
the other has been turned off.